# The Wandering Rescuer has double strike (3 damage twice, 20 -> 14) and gives hexproof to OTHER tapped creatures only: once it
# attacks it is tapped but has no hexproof, so Bot2's Lightning Bolt can target it (it survives: 3 damage on a 3/4). The
# Ornithopter that stayed home untapped has none either.

